"She binds a semi-intelligent water elemental named Flo that floats beside her as a ball of water."
"Flo can form faces and limbs, has its own core and abilities, and is rude to Nick."
"Flo can burst into a swarm of flying piranhas made of water."
"Channeling spells through Flo multiplies them, such as a jet of water that gouges armor."
"Her eyes swirl like storm waves, and she wears magical piercings and a sky-blue robe."
"Her slender sword poisons the blood of anything it wounds."
"She is Kenji's second in command and dislikes Nick."
